    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index climbed by 405 points week-on-week to 4,522, edging back above the year-ago level. The W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate increased by $0.75/t to $7.55/t, while there was a $2,750/day rise in the round-voyage rate to $7,000/day.",
